      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-28T17:53:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is required for other NPCX (boards)[https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/third_party/zephyr/main/boards/nuvoton/npcx9m6f_evb/npcx9m6f_evb_defconfig;l\u003d9] as well and is used (here)[https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/third_party/zephyr/main/soc/nuvoton/npcx/common/CMakeLists.txt;l\u003d34] to correctly set properties of the output binary. Nuvoton/CH likely can provide more detail here if needed.",
