      "writtenOn": "2025-02-25T17:11:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this necessary to avoid double initialization when `CONFIG_EC_HOST_CMD_INITIALIZE_AT_BOOT` is enabled? If that\u0027s the case I would put `fp_transport_init()` and `SYS_INIT` from line 60 under one `#ifndef CONFIG_EC_HOST_CMD_INITIALIZE_AT_BOOT`\n\n@dawidn@google.com what do you think about it?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 49,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 49,
        "endChar": 48
      },
      "revId": "c9832b16744771b2dd8f2716da5babe87b4c18e1",
